# Keep every text file at LF in the working copy, on every platform.
#
# This is not cosmetic: the reference renders in tests/golden/ are compared
# cell by cell against renderer output, so if a Windows checkout converted them
# to CRLF the golden tests would fail on a carriage return that the renderer
# never emits. Pinning eol here keeps the working copy identical to what CI and
# a fresh clone elsewhere will see.
* text=auto eol=lf
